SF0073 Charter school funding-amendments.
Sponsored By: Senator(s) Brennan, Boner, Dockstader, Driskill,
Nethercott and Olsen and Representative(s) Andrew,
Bear, Lawley and Lien
AN ACT relating to charter schools; allocating school district central office
nonpersonnel expenses to charter schools as specified; allocating school
district central office personnel to charter schools on a proportional basis as
specified; and providing for an effective date.
